{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00025",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 7.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.32,
      "text": "Hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.63,
      "end_seconds": 12.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Right, of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.89,
      "end_seconds": 23.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.72,
      "text": "Well, uh, I've been feeling very thirsty, and I wanted to get it checked. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.48,
      "end_seconds": 30.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.6,
      "end_seconds": 34.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "I've, I've had it for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.9,
      "end_seconds": 39.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.67,
      "end_seconds": 50.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "I'd say moderate. I've been going to the toilet a lot, even at night too. I've, I've been losing weight without trying too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.92,
      "end_seconds": 55.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Go on. Any blurred vision, abdominal pain or fruity smell on the breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.88,
      "end_seconds": 62.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "No, no blurred vision, abdominal pain or fruity smell on the breath."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.29,
      "end_seconds": 65.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Any vomiting or breathlessness at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.23,
      "end_seconds": 68.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "No, no vomiting or breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.48,
      "end_seconds": 72.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.44,
      "end_seconds": 81.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, I take bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day for the heart rhythm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.28,
      "end_seconds": 86.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.23,
      "end_seconds": 100.74,
      "duration_seconds": 13.51,
      "text": "Just a knee arthroscopy, three years ago. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.56,
      "end_seconds": 105.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.31,
      "end_seconds": 118.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.26,
      "text": "Hmm, I have an irregular heartbeat, for two years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.12,
      "end_seconds": 127.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "Okay, an irregular heartbeat, that's already on your record. Good to know. Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.4,
      "end_seconds": 141.73,
      "duration_seconds": 12.33,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.69,
      "end_seconds": 150.23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.01,
      "end_seconds": 154.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Okay, so no, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.61,
      "end_seconds": 159.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.84,
      "end_seconds": 160.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.49,
      "end_seconds": 175.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.76,
      "end_seconds": 181.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.1,
      "end_seconds": 185.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.88,
      "end_seconds": 199.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and non-tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.02,
      "end_seconds": 200.72,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.51,
      "end_seconds": 204.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.6,
      "end_seconds": 219.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "You're a little dry, but alert, and your breathing is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.14,
      "end_seconds": 230.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.08,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Just to be sure I've got this right, the bisoprolol, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.66,
      "end_seconds": 233.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "2.5 milligrams. Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.72,
      "end_seconds": 257.67,
      "duration_seconds": 20.95,
      "text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like possible new-onset diabetes. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. I'd also keep a urine infection in mind. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling very thirsty for six months, moderate, and no abdominal pain or breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 258.72,
      "end_seconds": 260.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.67,
      "end_seconds": 269.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "I'm going to order a urine test, for polyuria. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.04,
      "end_seconds": 273.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.48,
      "end_seconds": 283.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "We should do a blood sugar test for polydipsia and polyuria. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.39,
      "end_seconds": 286.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.44,
      "end_seconds": 318.36,
      "duration_seconds": 28.92,
      "text": "Until we have the results, avoid sugary drinks and fruit juices, and keep drinking plain water. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Please don't sit on it if you start vomiting or become drowsy. That's the point to get seen urgently. Come back tomorrow with the results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.45,
      "end_seconds": 325.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.99,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.45,
      "end_seconds": 331.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "So, I come back tomorrow with the results. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.81,
      "end_seconds": 335.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.6,
      "end_seconds": 341.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "I mean, no, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}